5. SHARE-ALIKE & SOURCE AVAILABILITY (where permission is granted)
   Any fork, port, or derivative work this license's permission is
   granted for must itself be distributed under this exact same
   license and must not be re-licensed. Any publicly distributed
   binary or compiled form of the Software or its derivatives must be
   accompanied by a publicly accessible link to its complete, unedited
   source code.

6. NO REDISTRIBUTION OF GENERATED GAME OUTPUT
   This Software is a static recompilation tool: it transforms a
   user's own, legally-obtained copy of copyrighted game software into
   a form that runs on different hardware. The Software itself
   contains no assets, code, or other content taken from any such
   game, and no project operated under this license hosts or
   distributes any such copyrighted game content -- it is injected
   locally by each user from their own legal copy. Any `.nro`, ROM,
   asset archive, or other output produced by running this Software
   against a copyrighted game is NOT covered by this license and is
   NOT authorized for redistribution -- doing so is copyright
   infringement, independent of and in addition to whatever
   restrictions the original game's copyright holder imposes, and
   independent of and in addition to whatever separate terms the
   relevant game publisher (e.g. Activision, for the Skylanders
   series) imposes on its own software, which every user remains
   separately responsible for complying with. This Software is
   provided solely for personal, educational, and interoperability
   purposes against games the user already legitimately owns.

